Mic Board Left PCB (textual): mic_board_left.kicad_pcb

Board outline: 12mm x 9mm
Placement:
- U1 at center with acoustic port hole in silkscreen and keepout
- J1 at board edge for JST SH 4-pin

Assembly notes:
- Reflow profile compatible (LMA3729T is reflowable)
- Keep microphone away from motor vibrations
